      "writtenOn": "2018-06-04T18:05:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This means separate Manager can synchronize using the same cache, which I assume is why ACME keys and tokens are cached. That\u0027s a feature of the Manager and how it uses Cache, not of the underlying implementation (which might in fact not be safe for concurrent use).",
